@startuml state_machine_pipeline
!theme plain
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam StateBackgroundColor #EBF5FB

title State Machine: AI Pipeline (Document + Video Processing)

[*] --> UPLOADING : create upload session

state UPLOADING : browser PUT to MinIO\nvia presigned URL
UPLOADING --> UPLOADED : confirm upload
UPLOADING --> ERROR : upload failed / timeout

state UPLOADED : file persisted in MinIO\nmetadata in PostgreSQL
UPLOADED --> QUEUED : publish DocumentUploaded\nor VideoUploaded

state QUEUED : job enqueued in BullMQ\nawaiting worker

state input_type <<choice>>
QUEUED --> input_type : worker acquires job

input_type --> PARSING : document\nPDF / DOCX / PPTX
input_type --> TRANSCRIBING : video / audio

state PARSING : document-worker downloads\nextract text + OCR fallback
PARSING --> CHUNKING : parsed OK
PARSING --> ERROR : parse failed

state CHUNKING : split by heading path\nmap chunks to LO if available
CHUNKING --> EMBEDDING : chunks persisted\n+ outbox events committed
CHUNKING --> ERROR : chunk failed

state TRANSCRIBING : video-worker extracts audio\nWhisper STT + timestamps
TRANSCRIBING --> SEGMENTING : transcript ready
TRANSCRIBING --> ERROR : STT failed

state SEGMENTING : segment transcript\ncut clips with FFmpeg\npersist video_segments
SEGMENTING --> EMBEDDING : publish TranscriptReady
SEGMENTING --> ERROR : segment / clip failed

state EMBEDDING : BGE-M3 1024-dim vectors\nupsert to Qdrant
EMBEDDING --> INDEXED : vector index OK
EMBEDDING --> ERROR : embed / upsert failed

state INDEXED : Qdrant has chunks / segments\nPostgreSQL status synced
INDEXED --> [*] : publish TextIndexed\nor VideoIndexed

state ERROR : persist last_error\nand last_success_state\nshow Retry to instructor
ERROR --> QUEUED : manual retry / requeue

note right of EMBEDDING
  PostgreSQL is source of truth.
  Qdrant upsert runs inline in the same worker
  AFTER the PG commit (no Outbox needed).
  Outbox Poller + BullMQ is used ONLY for
  the asynchronous Neo4j graph projection.
end note

note right of INDEXED
  Downstream Micro-Content and Quiz Generation
  pipelines run as separate event consumers.
end note

@enduml
